{"id":"steam-1385280","steam":1385280,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Crimson Core","summary":"Part traditional RPG; part adventure, horror, and dating sim, Crimson Core is a turn-based RPG with a choice-driven narrative. Each choice can push the game into a different path unlocking multiple endings.","about":"In Crimson Core you play as Kenji, a part time pizza delivery guy and college student who gets summoned to another world by the Blade Maiden of Bell Village, Mora. However, it becomes apparent that Kenji is not the hero Mora or the people of Bell were hoping for.\r\nTaking responsibility upon herself for her summoning fumble, Mora vows to find a way for Kenji to return to his world. Thus begins an adventure into the unknown!\r\n\r\nPart traditional RPG, part adventure, horror, and dating sim, Crimson Core is a turn-based RPG with a choice-driven narrative. Each choice can push the game into a different path unlocking multiple endings.\r\n\r\nFeaturing:\r\n-A Deep Original Story\r\n-Multiple Endings\r\n-Retro Turn Base RPG Goodness\r\n-Strategic Battles\r\n-Customizable Skill System\r\n-Monster Slaying\r\n-Animal Petting\r\n-Some Horror Aspects\r\n-Dating and Affection System\r\n-Original Anime Style Art and Sprites\r\n-Featuring Music by Lucas Ferreira\r\n-15-20 Hours of Gameplay","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385280/library_600x900.jpg?t=1789054336","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385280/header.jpg?t=1789054336","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385280/library_hero.jpg?t=1789054336","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385280/header.jpg?t=1789054336","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1385280/ss_e2f6005e81d30e71bd570bf64fce26e820c99172.600x338.jpg?t=1789054336","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati